# A release checklist with an item in neither state

## A condition that reads like an assurance

The archive carries the assembly and nothing else, which #1 recorded, and this is
what says so:

```
git grep -n 'nothing an operator did not choose' -- .github/workflows/
```

Whether a run answers that or whether somebody has to is what the item never says,
so a reader takes the sentence for the answer.
